<translation id="7309928523159922338">Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sivumela amasayithi owavakashelayo ukuba acele ulwazi ku-Decentr olusiza isayithi ukukala ukusebenza kwezikhangiso zawo. Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sikhawulela ukulandelela indawo yonke ngokudlulisa ulwazi oluncane ngangokunokwenzeka phakathi kwamasayithi.</translation>
<translation id="731795002583552498">Ibuyekeza i-Decentr</translation>
<translation id="7318036098707714271">Ifayela lakho lokuncamelayo limoshakele noma alivumelekile.

I-Decentr ayikwazi ukubuyisela izilungiselelo zakho.</translation>
