<translation id="7451052299415159299">I-Decentr idinga imvume yakho ukuze ifinyelele kukhamera yakho yaleli sayithi</translation>
<translation id="7461356015007898716">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-Decentr, uzodinga i-Windows 10 noma yakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa i-Windows 7.</translation>
