<translation id="8105840573057009683">I-Decentr idinga imvume yendawo kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="8133124826068723441">I-DecentrOS ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngoba Ukuvumelanisa akutholakali kusizinda sakho.</translation>
