<translation id="81770708095080097">Leli fayela liyingozi, ngakho-ke i-Decentr iyivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="8232193495299001329">I-Decentr ayikwazi ukuqinisekisa ukuthi lesi sandiso sivelaphi, futhi kungenzeka ukuthi asiphephile. Sisuse ku-Decentr ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="8248265253516264921">Uma isithombe singanayo incazelo ephelele, i-Decentr izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-Google. Ungavala lokhu kuzilungiselelo noma kunini.</translation>
