<translation id="8290862415967981663">Leli fayela lingaba yingozi, ngakho-ke i-Decentr iyivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="8318772038038596122">Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Decentr uma ingasetshenziswa isikhathi esingu-<ph name="TIMEOUT_DURATION" />.</translation>
